{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_117_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_117_title", "source_sha256": "031273433f2bfbcb8992649a442d8b6e39897e530c178528ffc71efcd9853281", "ja": "ひとひらの花びら", "zh": "一片花瓣", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_117_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_117_synopsis", "source_sha256": "6c700b46a599c9a247c389ba2548d4e1ec57aab1e09b910541a384dfcf97d348", "ja": "音楽フェスをやりきったアイドル達は貴音の\n頼もしさを称賛する。しかし貴音本人は何か\n思うところがある様子。里帰りした貴音は、\n心配したプロデューサーに心の内を打ち明け\n共に劇場へと戻ると告げる。", "zh": "圆满结束音乐节演出的偶像们纷纷称赞贵音\n非常可靠。然而贵音本人看起来却似乎\n若有所思。回乡探亲的贵音对担心的\n制作人倾诉了内心想法，\n并表示要与他一同回到剧场。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_117_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_117_1000_null", "source_sha256": "e9d535b92a4f752a336a84ac4b77ee68ecd4b56ac361648bc0541e3cad85e147", "ja": "音楽フェス『ミリ音』当日……", "zh": "音乐节『Mili音』当天……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_117_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_117_1001_038chz", "source_sha256": "0b1c36e1f9a97d4c1a883ae959ee856ae2d111184cfe8f6450560d24e5fe0af8", "ja": "もうすぐ本番ですわね。レッスンの成果をしっかり\n出せるよう……って、百合子。どうしたんですの？", "zh": "马上就要正式登场了呢。为了能充分展现出\n练习的成果……等等，百合子。你怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_117_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_117_1002_026yur", "source_sha256": "d308cb74007225f70ed883536775cfd8880ac911c4cfbd447367c6e40632ae3f", "ja": "そ、その……。想像以上にお客さんがいて、\nき、急に緊張してきたといいますか～。", "zh": "那、那个……客人比想象中还多，所、所以突然开始紧张起来了……或者说～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_117_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_117_1003_005yay", "source_sha256": "1550a067fc0bb627884277a00aad2531bb504eb98b8d18c6edc59958d073f235", "ja": "大丈夫ですか、百合子さん……。\nあ、そうだ。お水飲んだら、落ち着くかも！", "zh": "百合子小姐，你不要紧吧……\n啊，对了。喝点水的话，说不定能冷静下来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_117_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_117_1004_026yur", "source_sha256": "9b7e75ae13b72cb4499ed60e101f4e22b97a384747f51b52ab7a774bd23d1fcd", "ja": "じ、実はもうたっぷり飲んでみたんです！\nでも全然、ドキドキが止まらなくって……！", "zh": "其、其实我已经喝了好多水了！\n可是心跳还是完全停不下来……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_117_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_117_1005_008tak", "source_sha256": "0786657dadada0f64c6a0c4b322770d2cd7b5263947d1cb43907d4af75c91d7c", "ja": "……。\n百合子、少し手を……、よろしいですか？", "zh": "……。\n百合子，能稍微让我握一下……您的手吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_117_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_117_1006_null", "source_sha256": "1caed777cb39a80afba779e36eaa6ab6d2e53ce499b30af8407214a4897d0c07", "ja": "ギュッ", "zh": "紧紧", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_117_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_117_1007_026yur", "source_sha256": "9f2c14107f8b629e99cc4ab980cba92f37556992840fe877e8806bee5d423d03", "ja": "あっ……た、貴音さん……！\nあたたかい……。あと、いい匂い……♪", "zh": "啊……贵音小姐……！\n好温暖……而且，还有股好香的味道……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_117_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_117_1008_008tak", "source_sha256": "4fe01a347f1b22646e389b633d9128173b82542db4eeab87e9efcc7d530d628f", "ja": "人の温もりを感じると、不思議と落ち着くものです。\n……いかがですか？", "zh": "感受到人的温暖，就会不可思议地平静下来。\n……感觉如何？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_117_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_117_1009_026yur", "source_sha256": "78f6234e15a01085f60ec041b2760e6ad3f32e53d528682482f7b0a25aedff77", "ja": "は、はい……ありがとうございます、大丈夫そうです。\n別の意味でドキドキしてきましたけど……！", "zh": "是、是的……谢谢您，感觉应该没事了。\n不过，我好像因为另一种意义上的原因，开始心跳加速了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_117_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_117_1010_005yay", "source_sha256": "be4284f46a762c4ef66fde4beeab3b37e9da6bedce5e8c35da303bbbbb5e4744", "ja": "わぁ、よかったですね、百合子さん！\nえへへっ、貴音さん、魔法使いみたいかも！", "zh": "哇，太好了呢，百合子！\n嘿嘿，贵音好像魔法使一样呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_117_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_117_1011_037nao", "source_sha256": "d427a454815052f1ad36487a87d826a803e7488708f1d0d04740729cbb899384", "ja": "ホンマやな！　……ってことで千鶴、やよい。\n実は私も緊張してきて……手、握ってくれへん？", "zh": "确实呢！……所以说，千鹤、弥生。其实我也开始紧张了……能握住我的手吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_117_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_117_1012_038chz", "source_sha256": "22e0969e2d98f56603549500c5b7930960637e455548c34d313d0f68ea7703d6", "ja": "ふふっ、もちろん構いませんわよ。いっそ皆で\n輪になって、気持ちを一つにして本番を迎えましょう！", "zh": "呵呵，当然没问题。干脆大家围成一圈，齐心协力迎接正式演出吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_117_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_117_1013_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_117_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_117_1014_audience", "source_sha256": "acc8581c695ab26f18b2065c2f4de0a16fdc040eada53f2f523dd7e49984c20e", "ja": "ワアアアアァァァァァーーーーッ！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊啊啊——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_117_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_117_1016_p", "source_sha256": "cfec6afb250f005c99e4552a994b38b5c698eb9d6665683ef268c624d1cfc06d", "ja": "みんな、お疲れ様！　やっぱりステージには間に合わ\nなかったけど……バッチリ盛り上がったみたいだな！", "zh": "大家，辛苦了！虽然还是没能赶上舞台演出……\n不过看起来气氛相当热烈啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_117_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_117_1017_037nao", "source_sha256": "4f1eab56bad4e54462582442aad88d0518bed7574d3a803d9ce4b6df63b74790", "ja": "えへへ、任せてください♪　ちょっと歌う前に\n緊張したぐらいで、まあまあ完ぺきでした♪", "zh": "嘿嘿，交给我吧♪ 只是在唱歌前稍微有点紧张，不过总体来说还是完美的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_117_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_117_1018_p", "source_sha256": "c9880bce1258fbb8783a34f6fc285fef11b40d5dc31580abe1247ba9fc1b7d69", "ja": "でも、スタッフさんに聞いたけど……\nステージでは機材トラブルも起こったんだって？", "zh": "不过，我听工作人员说……舞台上还发生了设备故障？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_117_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_117_1019_026yur", "source_sha256": "70660448b13c6ed57a9dec0882870aa430d2ec630afbd0db918f4451ce708cbe", "ja": "そうなんですっ。せっかく緊張を乗り越えてステージに\n立ったのに、曲の音が出なくて……！", "zh": "就是这样！好不容易克服紧张站上舞台，结果歌曲却没声音……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_117_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_117_1020_005yay", "source_sha256": "3bc02803dc5bb9d6f7979f499352e2fc1638973cd02d413d10fe6da83db7e6a8", "ja": "でも貴音さんがすぐ「しばしとーくを楽しみましょう」\nって言ってくれたから、大丈夫でした！", "zh": "不过多亏贵音前辈马上说：“我们先享受一会儿谈话吧。”所以没关系了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_117_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_117_1021_038chz", "source_sha256": "6047689f7af94173b1f2aece83333899ef6c29b67e721aeb0346446582b08999", "ja": "話題もあれこれと出してくれて、話も弾みましたわね。\n……つけ麺屋ゴン太夫、いつか必ず伺いますわ♪", "zh": "话题也一个接一个地聊了起来，真是聊得很投机呢。……沾面店“冈太夫”，我下次一定会去拜访♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_117_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_117_1022_p", "source_sha256": "10c88e89bb4414f6bc1170f1d872edc6d52e43792b49ab71045eceaa9b24ae72", "ja": "なるほど……本当に話が弾んだみたいですね。", "zh": "原来如此……看来你们真的聊得很投机呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_117_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_117_1023_038chz", "source_sha256": "249bea264522c036f18a6701c58f3252a04d090fabaf6676b9e38e2ccf0c870c", "ja": "それに本番前にも、皆を落ち着かせてくれましたし。\n今日は最初から最後まで、貴音に助けられました。", "zh": "而且正式演出前，您还让大家冷静了下来。\n今天从头到尾都多亏了贵音。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_117_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_117_1024_008tak", "source_sha256": "ed3c88dcd1887b118b06aa1d81b4e5d4b63a895b6deb4a98d1aca4811881dc1a", "ja": "そのようなこと……。とらぶるを乗り越えられたのは、\nここにいる全員の力があったからこそ。", "zh": "那种事……能克服这场麻烦，正是因为有在场所有人的力量。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_117_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_117_1025_026yur", "source_sha256": "d6d99d6a74da16df226354b99d26d81890e0c030c6ac401f3c207ab6844d3205", "ja": "でも、その力を引き出してくれたのは貴音さんです。\nそれでいて、音が出た後は歌で会場を魅了して……。", "zh": "不过，帮我们发挥出那份力量的，是贵音小姐。而且音乐响起后，还用歌声迷倒了全场……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_117_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_117_1026_026yur", "source_sha256": "98485e609f090afbdd7efb76e08c7969a87f07a9b062440ea83ebe975be1dc99", "ja": "はあ～♪　エミリーちゃんじゃないけど、\nやっぱり憧れちゃうなぁ～！", "zh": "哈啊～♪虽然不是艾米莉，但果然还是让人憧憬啊～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_117_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_117_1027_037nao", "source_sha256": "f8310d641c9b17c66f2b71b7bf7ec12c1d05e1eec37901ba8c5e87c32e23a460", "ja": "ホンマやなぁ。めっちゃ美人で物知りで、歌はもちろん\nトークも地味にうまくて、実は可愛いとこもあって……", "zh": "还真是啊。又漂亮又博学，唱歌自不必说，聊天也意外地很在行，而且其实还有可爱的一面……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_117_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_117_1028_037nao", "source_sha256": "4e4da0c47675d28410f40b4e1d2ef4091bb75b33e5a4e9d859dbb38fe15dd95c", "ja": "なんや貴音って、アイドルになるために\n生まれてきたみたいやんな！", "zh": "说什么嘛，贵音简直就像是为了成为偶像而生的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_117_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_117_1029_008tak", "source_sha256": "4a3f3c2687d46cab58e4f9f0f38078eac3edd6256fc3c8ba15278c9a885b21ab", "ja": "アイドルになるために……。\n私が、ですか？", "zh": "为了成为偶像……  \n说的是我吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_117_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_117_1030_037nao", "source_sha256": "24dd8033f9c67b08cdfacc85d71b28855324447af401563760f2fbf811bd2cba", "ja": "うん、ボーン・トゥー・ビー・アイドル！\nみたいな？", "zh": "嗯，就像“天生就是当偶像的料”那样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_117_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_117_1031_008tak", "source_sha256": "07ffc345af0a6b49d42c06fb6eb41048496340153c93284c9cb264c837da4b9c", "ja": "そうですか……。アイドルになるために。\n……私は、そのようにも見えるのですね。", "zh": "这样啊……为了成为偶像。  \n……原来我在你眼里，也是那样的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_117_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_117_1032_p", "source_sha256": "69bdcff8a18559be4df489629d268d71d4d9bbc90bce4559ff79d58ae10ff7cd", "ja": "（貴音……？）", "zh": "（贵音……？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_117_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_117_1033_null", "source_sha256": "6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e", "ja": "数日後……", "zh": "过了几天后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_117_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_117_1034_p", "source_sha256": "8c15f065e2438b323a6b785903884ba00f42d036727f542a09b0e7edce2025cc", "ja": "（もうすぐ今日の公演が始まる。リハは順調に\n終わったものの、出演予定だった貴音は……）", "zh": "（今天的公演马上就要开始了。虽然彩排顺利结束了，可是预定出演的贵音却……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_117_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_117_1035_026yur", "source_sha256": "e88d23cba5c05dff5c44910a98c4af70b24366a7c3e48d1e1e05c4f5b6b3ce6d", "ja": "{$P$}さん。\n貴音さん、今日も帰ってこないんですか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生。\n贵音小姐今天也不回来吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_117_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_117_1036_037nao", "source_sha256": "4417f1f77795efe6fbfd76395f04f5a3c60ee1c2a75697a1ea7ed99eb69aa583", "ja": "急に京都に行く～いうてホンマに行ってから、\nもう一週間ぐらい経つんと違います？", "zh": "说是突然要去京都～，结果真的去了之后，已经差不多过了一周了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_117_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_117_1037_p", "source_sha256": "9e2b8207539379099bba9a15d206568d59140f1c0fb16bfd006913b07aa8ce7f", "ja": "ちょうど一週間かな。久しぶりだし、\n向こうでゆっくりしてるんだと思う。", "zh": "正好一周吧。毕竟难得去一趟，我想现在正在那边悠闲地待着。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_117_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_117_1038_p", "source_sha256": "1e55e6979b77f1e222a448b924cf90305becc3693ccbd9e9e1c8f7241d52de03", "ja": "急に休むことになったから、カバーするのは\n大変かもしれないけど、よろしく頼むぞ！", "zh": "因为是突然请假，顶班可能会\n有点辛苦，不过就拜托你啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_117_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_117_1039_005yay", "source_sha256": "532fee503a66f8566fc4d7186f04337c0cc71b38136cf4536e54b56c3e70acd4", "ja": "そんなの全然平気ですー。でも、3日くらいかなーって\n思ってたのに、こんなにお休みするなんて……。", "zh": "那完全没问题啦——不过，我还以为大概是3天左右，没想到居然要休息这么久……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_117_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_117_1040_037nao", "source_sha256": "f2c6dd91498904a33a7506626e7a64f370694e66d2bfa55e4d18b7fcb146749e", "ja": "私、『ミリ音』で余計なコト言うてしもたんかなぁ？\nなんや、あの時から様子おかしかったし……。", "zh": "我是不是在《百万音》里说了什么多余的话啊？总觉得从那时候起情况就有点不对劲……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_117_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_117_1041_038chz", "source_sha256": "046fced6fb4e7009e0d5d4631fed4a0e4a66028844d6c1b7a0246d17d1a5cce7", "ja": "何か事情があるのかもしれませんけれど。\n{$P$}は、何か聞いていますの？", "zh": "或许是有什么隐情吧。不过，{$P$}，您听说了什么吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_117_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_117_1042_p", "source_sha256": "94d6185a9f7ba5163c9d4709455f165f592f0225adc6326fe1cf92fc36a91efb", "ja": "いえ、スケジュールはいろいろ調整しましたが……\n特に休む理由は聞いていませんね。", "zh": "不，虽然已经做了各种日程调整，不过……\n我没听说她有什么特别的休息理由。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_117_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_117_1043_026yur", "source_sha256": "d08b927fd8242a6c80e2f227df48e05f7568f54fce290d1e199dfd2a13f96594", "ja": "でも、もうすぐ貴音さんの定期公演ですよね？\nいろいろ準備もあると思うんですけど……。", "zh": "不过，贵音小姐的定期公演马上就要开始了吧？\n应该还有很多准备工作要做……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_117_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_117_1044_005yay", "source_sha256": "4200f11648abd90cd8f9d775555c3a8a35118199490e891b9a3c08334aed992c", "ja": "{$P$}、貴音さん、\n公演までにちゃんと帰ってきてくれますよね？", "zh": "{$P$}，贵音姐姐会在公演前好好回来吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_117_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_117_1045_p", "source_sha256": "2ac4c4d4f921bd336a5381592cb1326c038502cb92fb5438f783e239b40b6418", "ja": "もちろん、帰ってくる……と、思う。", "zh": "当然会回来的……我、我是这么觉得的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_117_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_117_1046_005yay", "source_sha256": "460cf421da2e330d532c85f27cfa6ba1f092fd1ea121f1588a61756ddf930b3a", "ja": "ええっ～！？　思うだけですか～！？", "zh": "诶——！？只是觉得会回来吗～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_117_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_117_1047_038chz", "source_sha256": "c75cbf9b0e6caeddea68afdbadefbee9c5f7f87378485a1d71de28b91b348040", "ja": "定期公演前……。だからこそ、なのでしょうか。\n何か思う所でも……。", "zh": "定期公演前……正因如此，才会这样吗？\n难道是有什么想法……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_117_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_117_1048_p", "source_sha256": "acdb9f93098be3a77f5b6196661abfae2209b8c1ce88c0b33c77ade88d1e12e8", "ja": "……貴音は「一週間ほど」とは言ってたんですよ。\nだから、本当に帰ってくるとは思います。", "zh": "……贵音当时确实是说了“大概一周左右”。\n所以，我想她是真的会回来的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_117_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_117_1049_p", "source_sha256": "19bbd8dbcaab1c947acc956ad9307b1ef60c9063d9d0f6b8884023457571f8b9", "ja": "でも……そうですね。", "zh": "不过……也是啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_117_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_117_1050", "source_sha256": "f464125594043faf887c03d67e27fbb5e1047d6b1bbbaf0c5e036d57eb637d6a", "ja": "迎えに行く", "zh": "去接你", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_117_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_117_2000_p", "source_sha256": "617d32213c53c64e2999d8b65d7494ed1bee6417410224fb86828228c4e9ea8e", "ja": "明日、ちょっと行ってみます。\n……貴音を迎えに。", "zh": "明天，我去试试看。\n……去接贵音。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_117_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_117_2001_null", "source_sha256": "f01f3d447378ced21494a5ca52840c4f7e6aefdbf993d9e7144d1c4d8841e0c3", "ja": "―翌日―", "zh": "──隔天──", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_117_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_117_2002_p", "source_sha256": "5a50c7f290eeff46bd1148e1674c36f2dc4deab85dabd821295847e81433560b", "ja": "（貴音と連絡を取って、現地で待ち合わせをした。\n貴音は……）", "zh": "（联系了贵音，和她约好在现场碰面。贵音她……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_117_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_117_2003_008tak", "source_sha256": "175b1aa51b639bc13fc8f28aa3fc9751dbd0ef950cd5c0051f83f26eacc6e1a6", "ja": "{$P$}……。\n本当に、来てくださったのですね……。", "zh": "{$P$}……。\n您真的来了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_117_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_117_2004_008tak", "source_sha256": "69402fab783347fc97cc21724b58e3622a1c657cf00519e5315ff38f1a7e729b", "ja": "いえ、それよりも……申し訳ありませんでした。\nこの度は、とんだご足労をおかけしてしまい……。", "zh": "不，比起这个……真的很抱歉。\n这次让您特意跑一趟，实在是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_117_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_117_2005_p", "source_sha256": "76eba34815c8b6ac04ae01dec70cca8aaa44479c50a0b2479e2eeedd10f0b439", "ja": "本当はもう少し、そっとしておきたかったんだけど。\nでも、みんなも心配してたから。それに……。", "zh": "其实我本来想再让你一个人静一静的。不过，大家也都很担心你。而且……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_117_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_117_2006_p", "source_sha256": "7f724c66d589be7dafcefdea12714710d5bc475afdd0def98093ae7626aaea51", "ja": "もし貴音が、何かの整理をしていたのなら……。\nその場所にいる貴音と、会っておきたかったんだ。", "zh": "如果贵音当时正在整理什么的话……我想去见见身处那里的贵音。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_117_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_117_2007_008tak", "source_sha256": "9986149e4469e6f7532d1a5b170debe6f2ca5dfe23d18daeec012a4dda6ca061", "ja": "……お見通しなのですね。でも、何も仰らないで。\n本当に、いけずなお方です。", "zh": "……您都看穿了呢。不过，请什么都不要说。\n您可真是个爱使坏的人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_117_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_117_2008_008tak", "source_sha256": "fd97608950a5684948a403b9b9c895b66af8a0c9dbba3f09a24cdb9898186346", "ja": "皆にも心配をかけてしまいました。後ほどめーるを\n出しておきます。これから戻ります、と……。", "zh": "让大家也担心了。稍后我会发封邮件，说一声“我这就回去”……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_117_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_117_2009_p", "source_sha256": "e6b30c82c0920934ee0a14845fc484764f7fe502c57afafcd144cfa9e40362a1", "ja": "……心の整理は、できたってことかな？", "zh": "……看来心情已经整理好了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_117_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_117_2010_008tak", "source_sha256": "6e0b1d83ffe43cfca7a2c4da90414484360bae7e66b8e16268b753e879ad45e9", "ja": "さて……どうなのでしょう。\n答えにたどり着けたのかは、よくわかりません。", "zh": "那么……究竟如何呢？\n我也不太清楚，自己是否已经找到答案。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_117_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_117_2011_008tak", "source_sha256": "4a7e966a853a89a1acfb9e58e822af0dd68286d5b9ba519668b8c59a12e9f8ee", "ja": "私は、自分を見つめ直すために戻ってまいりました。\n初心に返り、己の望む道を、もう一度見出すために。", "zh": "我是为了重新审视自己才回来的。\n回到最初的起点，再一次找寻自己所期望的道路。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_117_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_117_2012_008tak", "source_sha256": "c27f470d570defb95d2bce79572a2b5848d7b9a6354c6acd89ed42cfe98fdb49", "ja": "アイドルである私を、皆ほめてくれます。\n私自身、納得のいく舞台ができているように思います。", "zh": "大家都称赞身为偶像的我。\n我自己也觉得，似乎已经能够呈现出令自己满意的舞台了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_117_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_117_2013_008tak", "source_sha256": "a3ca5b4da6e4b030982f87ff785458bffa131b70d22627eb9fc13a5b1fdb6e58", "ja": "ただ、それが何故なのか……。\nアイドルであることに、私は何を望んでいるのか……。", "zh": "可是，为什么会这样……  \n我成为偶像，又是为了追求什么……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_117_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_117_2014_p", "source_sha256": "fecca012ea3b4e64139ed1735dbcd725c5a77811de5dcb2df6fc9611396de746", "ja": "それを探しにきたんだな。\nそれで……見つかった？", "zh": "所以，你就是来寻找那个答案的吧。\n那么……找到了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_117_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_117_2015_008tak", "source_sha256": "2304250e9350eb919ad3e06cf897430b9305d5444cba14539a85771d5ce8ba5d", "ja": "……ふふっ。いいえ。\n何も見つかりませんでした。", "zh": "……呵呵。没有。\n什么都没有找到。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_117_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_117_2016_008tak", "source_sha256": "c0c3466918a97de65a2038774b2a5f7969b70202d89d2f54bb89c4b297841df6", "ja": "目的もなく、寄る辺もなく。ただ風に舞う花びらの\nように世界をさ迷っている、今の私には……。", "zh": "没有目的，也无处可依。如今的我……就像随风飘舞的花瓣，在世间彷徨。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_117_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_117_2017_008tak", "source_sha256": "94b0839b38fb38a71c94aadcc1908c5a13ede6f0bce138dfdcdd961ddc06238a", "ja": "たどり着きたい場所など、どこにもないのです。\nこの身にある望みは、ただひとつ……。", "zh": "并没有任何想要抵达的地方。\n我此身所怀的愿望，唯有一个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_117_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_117_2018_008tak", "source_sha256": "91313d6139fe9e4a6d91d76f4cd796ff84c9647a0e0c9e21c08bdaecb8c477ce", "ja": "私は、アイドルでいたい。この世界、大切な仲間達、\nそれから……あなた様の、そばにいるために。", "zh": "我想一直当偶像。为了留在这个世界、珍视的伙伴们，\n还有……您的身边。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
